// S-900 (spec §6.3: "`<` `<=` `>` `>=` は `PartialOrd` に絞る。既にある境界が候補の trait に含まれるときは置き換える"): E0401 for `a < b` where
// `T: Eq`. `PartialOrd` does not contain `Eq` (it is above `PartialEq` only), so the one candidate keeps the bound and joins the
// trait: `T: Eq + PartialOrd`. No diagnostic is left after it.

pub fn below[T: Eq](a: T, b: T) -> Bool {
  a < b                                             //~ E0401
}
